    {"type":"text","id":"prec_list","x":1170,"y":188,"width":300,"height":200,"text":"1. hard_timeout  (provider 시작 후)\n2. cancelled  (rpc / stop)\n3. blocked  (liveness)\n4. aborted  (명시적 abort)\n5. timed_out\n6. failed\n7. completed","originalText":"1. hard_timeout  (provider 시작 후)\n2. cancelled  (rpc / stop)\n3. blocked  (liveness)\n4. aborted  (명시적 abort)\n5. timed_out\n6. failed\n7. completed","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":200051,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.7},
    {"type":"text","id":"prec_note","x":1170,"y":400,"width":310,"height":80,"text":"sticky = 한 번 정해지면 이후 에러가 강등 못 함.\n예외: 완료가 hard_timeout '이전'에 끝났다면 timeout 으로 강등 허용.","originalText":"sticky = 한 번 정해지면 이후 에러가 강등 못 함.\n예외: 완료가 hard_timeout '이전'에 끝났다면 timeout 으로 강등 허용.","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","strokeColor":"#64748b","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":200052,"version":1,"versionNonce":1,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null,"lineHeight":1.4},

